"P955819763" "You stole these explosives from Cage security guards on Sharkhead Isle. They should prove valuable in creating a distraction that will let you get to the Back Alley Brawler."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeOneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1135507640" "Brawling with the Big Boys"
// DetailString :
"P4107603473" "It began with a contract on the Back Alley Brawler, issued by Arachnos to Crimson Revenant. The hero hunter knew whoever did the job would take a lot of heat from the Paragon City government, so he passed the job on to you. Of course, the Brawler would be well-guarded. To get to him, you first had to create a distraction. You journeyed to Sharkhead Isle, where you stole a number of Cage Consortium explosives. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeTwoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P1195218567" "It began with a contract on the Back Alley Brawler, issued by Arachnos to Crimson Revenant. The hero hunter knew whoever did the job would take a lot of heat from the Paragon City government, so he passed the job on to you. Of course, the Brawler would be well-guarded. To get to him, you first had to create a distraction. You journeyed to Sharkhead Isle, where you stole a number of Cage Consortium explosives. <br><br>Back in Nerva, the plot thickened. You took the explosives to the Longbow base intended to receive the Back Alley Brawler, and planted them. You then made your escape and triggered the explosives, leaving a blasted mess in your wake. The Brawler's welcome was certain to be less secure now. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL6_NA_Crimson_Revenant_Miniarc2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P2680984961" "The Brawler's mask"
// tDetailString :
"P1535824063" "You've kept the mask of the Back Alley Brawler as a trophy. It's a reminder of the adventure you like to call: <br><br>Brawling with the Big Boys <br><br>It began with a contract on the Back Alley Brawler, issued by Arachnos to Crimson Revenant. The hero hunter knew whoever did the job would take a lot of heat from the Paragon City government, so he passed the job on to you. Of course, the Brawler would be well-guarded. To get to him, you first had to create a distraction. You journeyed to Sharkhead Isle, where you stole a number of Cage Consortium explosives. <br><br>Back in Nerva, the plot thickened. You took the explosives to the Longbow base intended to receive the Brawler, and planted them. You then made your escape and triggered the explosives, leaving a blasted mess in your wake. The Back Alley Brawler's welcome was certain to be less secure now. <br><br>The Brawler arrived on Liberty Isle, but Longbow had not yet had time to muster a new security regiment. You swooped in and tore the hero to shreds. He now bides her time in an Arachnos prison, and you have risen in infamy both at home and in Paragon City. Not a bad day's work."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P23650840" "Arachnos has learned that a member of the Freedom Phalanx is visiting Crimson Cove. Naturally, this can't be allowed to happen. Arachnos could give the job to their own Operative Rutger, but they know this one has to succeed. So, wisely, they have come to me. And, knowing your talents, I have come to you. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Together, we can take out the Back Alley Brawler.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1664984668" "Take out the Back Alley Brawler"
// SendOffString :
"P387934034" "The Brawler is likely to be extremely well guarded, so we'll have to begin by creating a distraction. Get over to the Hellforge in Sharkhead Isle and steal some explosives. I'll fill you in on the rest of the plan after that."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3354012469" "Steal explosives"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3264583742" "Those explosives will be key in our plan to bring down the Back Alley Brawler."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
